{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415667","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415667","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566701:1":{"text":"자, 이사벨라. 따뜻한 우유부터 마셔.","source_cn":"来，伊莎贝拉，先喝杯热牛奶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C74A9C95B87B5D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566702:1":{"text":"이번 임무를 다녀오면서 너에게 줄 책을 하나 가져왔어.","source_cn":"我这次任务顺便为你带了一本小册子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D129A4C93C1C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566703:1":{"text":"선원이 쓴 모험 이야기래.","source_cn":"据说是水手写的冒险故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x376FE3532A357A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566704:1":{"text":"선원? 죽음의 함대와 같은 해적 이야기야?","source_cn":"水手？像死潮舰队那样的海盗故事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A20D752D62B4F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566705:1":{"text":"비슷하겠지... 아마도. 아무튼 배를 타고 모험하는 이야기야.","source_cn":"类似吧……大概，总之是有人开船的故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341745CD71868068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566706:1":{"text":"언니의 책 소개는 항상 너무 짧아.","source_cn":"姐姐对书本的评论太简洁啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738920671D1F7057","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566707:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 이번 임무도 배를 타고 갔어? 해적이나 인어는 봤어?","source_cn":"说起来，姐姐这次任务也是坐船往返吗？有见到海盗和美人鱼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833A695E99E5F1B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566708:1":{"text":"탔어. 해적은 만났지만 인어는... 그게 인어였는지는 모르겠어.","source_cn":"坐船，见到了海盗，但人鱼……我不确定那算不算是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5831CDA48A97220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566709:1":{"text":"대부분은 인간을 만났지.","source_cn":"主要还是与人类打交道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82016A3ECBA7F010","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566710:1":{"text":"간식 좀 가져올게. 천천히 앉아서 책 보고 있어.","source_cn":"我去给你拿些点心，你在这里慢慢看书吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AF8A5357B482923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566711:1":{"text":"언니는 임무 이야기를 물어보면 항상 말을 돌리더라...","source_cn":"每次一问姐姐任务，她就岔开话题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6DF189B0583BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566712:1":{"text":"난 언제쯤 언니에게 도움이 될 수 있을까...","source_cn":"不知道什么时候才能帮得上姐姐的忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE08C730AD33C63C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:西尔维娜":{"text":"실비나","source":"西尔维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莎贝拉":{"text":"이사벨라","source":"伊莎贝拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}